        }
      }
    },
    "A profile remembers which section every item is in. Apply one here, from Rolltop’s menu, with a shortcut or from an automation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预设会记住每一项所在的分区。可以在此处、Rolltop 菜单、快捷键或自动化中应用预设。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A profile with a display rule is applied when the connected displays change to match it. When none matches, nothing changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设有显示器规则的预设会在连接的显示器变为与之匹配时应用。没有匹配的预设时，不会有任何变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
